            "id": "PreserveOriginalRGB",
            "code": "// 四边复用原稿无字装饰取样；中央透明，由页面自己的背景承载，不以生成画稿代替原稿颜色。\nfloat2 P=UV;\nAlpha=1;\nif(UV.y<0.16) P=float2(UV.x,UV.y*1.375);\nelse if(UV.y>0.84) P=float2(UV.x,0.76+(UV.y-0.84)*1.5);\nelse if(UV.x<0.16) P=float2(UV.x*1.75,0.20+UV.y*0.58);\nelse if(UV.x>0.84) P=float2(0.72+(UV.x-0.84)*1.75,0.20+UV.y*0.58);\nelse Alpha=0;\nfloat3 C=Texture2DSample(Source,SourceSampler,P).rgb;\nAlpha*=Texture2DSample(Matte,MatteSampler,P).a;\nreturn C;",
            "description": "保留原稿RGB，显示遮罩只修改Alpha；项目第三层客户端UI专用",
            "output_type": "float3",
