            "code": "// 形状亮度取实时图标最大通道，避免紫蓝图案被绿色亮度权重和第二次乘算压黑。\nfloat4 I=Texture2DSample(Icon,IconSampler,UV);\nfloat Shape=pow(saturate(max(I.r,max(I.g,I.b))),.45);\nfloat3 Dark=Texture2DSample(Palette,PaletteSampler,float2(.470,.480)).rgb;\nfloat3 Mid=Texture2DSample(Palette,PaletteSampler,float2(.495,.510)).rgb;\nfloat3 Highlight=Texture2DSample(Palette,PaletteSampler,float2(.515,.570)).rgb;\nfloat3 C=lerp(Dark,Mid,smoothstep(0,.65,Shape));\nC=lerp(C,Highlight,smoothstep(.65,1,Shape));\nAlpha=I.a;\nreturn C;",
